{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1416,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d86434755b7b6bf8a3358b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『道路拥堵，忒毒忒堵』……\r\n欸嘿嘿，这是新想的冷笑话。\r\n希望能让会长开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90eae0f368a65f77cda39f2903a88e1f055f1f5e85a6deae7033edabc8f51efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c92cf105d15de7462d511019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚志，参上——咳咳，\r\n咳咳！！小鹰教给我的\r\n招牌台词，真难啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedfaf696349e945c10794c460e93228d02f54538c8fc60750638904f4678999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:538acc9685bafa3b72522c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经常去保健室的我能勉强跟上学习，\r\n都是多亏了小草老师。\r\n真是太感谢了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4533d0759183b45da478b3d21970bbc9f011480e39b82dcc90b7081b17a67ebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8d040da4e0fe4c2cb5f730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校门边上发现了一只小猫咪！\r\n拍张照片发给小青的话。\r\n她应该会很开心吧？欸嘿嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c802756f0a261a24f7ca30ee7bb2e13edc58766e79c83b8c1e090484b357426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7935fb220026eb01898e7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣・王！圣・王！！\r\n今天也要干劲十足地\r\n让小圣王露出笑容~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeda8dc16efd76cd476e86e860f23efa7427a9a8907beec34e10aa3524b9e929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a6fa37fab184ad38ec3e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞我还是有些自信的！\r\n毕竟小帝王有好好教过我了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "739608d811f4aef519f9cd84fbfb063fa3d71aa1c4feb9cb772b5b182a8970f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804c9ee4f744467ce419afa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上绝对要注意不能倒下。\r\n那么快乐的氛围，\r\n可不能给破坏了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd64fb5988dad924e7374862c6ed2e2ce9329f0380309fea52bb8e38b412aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c67c658aa28191e57e7e69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都帅气的鹤丸刚志！\r\n是终将制霸三冠的强力赛马娘！\r\n……我看起来有这种感觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bc1525aa26653ae6288a768c1a7a863da3079bea8c4be67c0086085c289b6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0719739ea93097bf3fd7fd37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意到了吗？没错，\r\n左袖是重点！穿着这件衣服的我\r\n可是很『强』的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85dfefc25ae35b4c60be4d7e31d7e30a2b3604eead896e69ef4f83d678bd2a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52252cf7af092211b28360e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员早上习惯吃面包还是米饭？\r\n我是米饭派的。面包怎么都\r\n很难消化呢~……啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "257783f395d4e8ee90bc37e431305b0bb0c3df136e4434678d465f68d4064dff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:193df19f6b27af1effe1ea01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手工做的香蕉蛋糕让小特很开心♪\r\n想不到她全都吃光光了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5696ede88ca543285e1829c2690993c8b597a65c8bcd2cb6e5015c2d164e4968",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef3906b03da0e5099b38d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和光明学姐说话会让人感到治愈\r\n变得能安然入睡呢。\r\n她是我最棒的室友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4186fb23bf6c2c09b718e0f5dd3e156b76303373223b74d4eb541b10501f0906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d79ba6d680dffdd2892d3e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『谢谢您为我带路！』，\r\n像这样被新生用闪亮亮的眼神\r\n表达感谢……！好、好开心~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d474472e11c9eaf19e906a5f0c62facbbd98b9885941e0b9e8899662f311f574",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e204d4d502d11938e764ccd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "台风、大雨、气压变化……唔……\r\n没问题，不会输的，不会输的，\r\n不会输的~~……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "494b83c6b800f1eb607bb4196a1106ca6c67829e16b58e467ab99a99ac087c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739cb3a3f98a84bd1aa442e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏乏一结束，秋盹又来了……\r\n唔……脑袋昏沉沉的~~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfa6208e46c2c048cb3c889f4cc58f46786ea8906729a2e782d3171042e775c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09ec35c935325f7365ae8721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，需要暖宝宝吗？\r\n我带了很多，\r\n要多少都行随便拿~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90344525a58509481fff6a2b5632b89546017d68558d5b7c66c91b9beb8fa4f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e174f74d5daddff773118b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请多多指教！\r\n我会用正确方法全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "636eaaed1a61e4a48af2c8d5297df880bc414de45d76e398b839823280bb830d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f35726dea47d1cf9f8a88af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004e7ad03760ca4de54eb8714ebf3d626f0737fd957dec00e92601dd4fdc23ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68203b7ae0c64162e2e40cb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首先要深呼吸……\r\n嘶~~哈~~——\r\n咳咳！咳咳咳！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beb34e39f7d78f299d2acd89029dc636e9484db4520dc8ae6cf5fe8d1068228",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2407995063581db8b1da65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越努力就越能不断变强！\r\n呜哦，要燃起来了~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb50b595696e64a16ccb8f3993764838fadb573298cafa3f8ae941c6b12212b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77606915a98bc1bd2c285f8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心！\r\n氧气喷雾和运动胶带\r\n都准备得很充足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd50ed338d321c3484bbee7237e0592b2d4f9839df786ea96c86afd369f60ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22d70753157eecf5f8fc126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为鲁道夫会长那样的\r\n三冠赛马娘！\r\n我要比任何人都更努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a2fe3f5cb0bb42ebe9cd0a28cc846e2c900aba15dce2fdfd651f25d6b02f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335e8b2c1f1ca225bed3ae02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家担心了，\r\n不过我完全还能努力！……嘿嘿，\r\n不用说也能明白的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d2ced3a953dc3575c5d7952ff555440bb010be242f72f105a92cd3c743282a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1c026a98bc988d4cb35310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我今天起的有点太早……\r\n——诶，训练员也是吗！？\r\n看来我们都得注意一下呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f9691dbe5426799b5f307efdc12f32f47489acd30137d371d9c369be9c6a69f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6993802abf72e834e595d004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耀眼的太阳！猛烈的热意！\r\n看来能完成最棒的训练呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbade65d351469a49d14984261c6200e96238ad38498b01aeaecd5ce5e30bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8b604db2bc0ee68e10ebdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你，我才能变得精神闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd47a98313f78b66c54fd2a996f2a0450755f0ca189021209896659cecf8ffd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf146934583f3d6faeecd35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴，竭尽所能，我做到啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f61acf97c851c020de2bc0147e87013282dfc18c1642f81351b39831e7d76b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774573bfc2b459cd5988b39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要成为更强的刚志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03cc32e6971fd90a1e9e655cef214f90ed05c0cbf674a25448a46b2fac0aa8ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b171acf5c5da2c3cf094f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就什么都能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "370629be8125326ce385acdb865417ea5c574ae649b3b37d7da96e68c3c99cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b601449f15e11d63d2429dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志，\r\n会加油的——咳咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d0b7193fe3abd87962d9b5a3a7ac13c55229ca287df07a26161cb3fedf53ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5aa8350273d42108c4e25a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还能发挥更多力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e15f811ce657a3d4f764c6d28d3a80c8b03689cdcd3307eb2541d55daeddc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68024e02fdcc1f5d57928344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我的全力支援吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96124cdb079cbf4890f8b9647b8b0b87e46c2cda3c098d1289da20155464e87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da68fe416e13e10738eb04ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上场了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01a590e1da97082479caaa8d69650d99bc78276106830b2805651212c04f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b59a78bf3f276a1368261a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耐心等着新芽萌发吧。\r\n我们有足够的实力\r\n容许我们不慌不忙地等待～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfc1f0a3699950373d6cc8964621e0d792b21fe4d5b16c7b25fc5149b6ab3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5f7286b5ce4cd7a4cbce09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行って参ります～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70663e5396e165a1176c0697689ea06022298bdbab4f2237e467b4572216c12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af44904dce8e8884c4c4a322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りましたわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88afe54f76e6ff6e0a5c64a83947a2a8927ea95bb82eb578996ad89f6aff108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc1e0d94132adddca3187cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在，无论冬天\r\n有多寒冷……我们都能一起\r\n等待春天来临呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7ab53be3cbb4d84388e2a6d5339a1e700bcacdacff7d359851c97f87b8a95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f728d5bfd5ff31588519390e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们只要维持属于自己的步调\r\n就好了呢～不须着急，\r\n坚持我们两人的作风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "151b16722b0282fde37bc335b63cceccbd5f6256fd778794bf18a8275fcf69e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce1ec2d6815b2b68b02627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向你说声新年快乐～\r\n今年的目标嘛……嗯～\r\n夏天来临前我会决定好的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef08e0ea8e4d7c62a2c2ea12669938915d0369c5bce646fec6d00e9e339b4fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1244cfeb347ecc5d58e0819c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请稍等一下喔～\r\n我记得我把巧克力……\r\n哎呀？难道忘在教室里了～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fbd02af5d40a4f234720ae4d7d28a94493c9b00a5c9dc75185b7d2fb20b6de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917f3f022fb675efee3bf6a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我可是做好了\r\n万全的事前准备喔？\r\n毕竟今天可是情人节呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d45b579b9bfacfee9d59c1893c8e89aa962f0b75acc4dac291d4754b7bb6c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5801722c586d61abc5b12548",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想好七夕愿望了吗？\r\n我呢……希望自己能赶在\r\n今天结束前挂上短签～",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ad722bf10c8f3ca930099bf47602c8691886ad5e1a9230c49ec008d36e762a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2317f2bed09065d36d771c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖我就要捣蛋喔～\r\n呵呵呵，我很擅长\r\n跟别人要糖果喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3c8fb353042c12c7e898aec58cd3bee4f47e7142153cd17ef37ef96e9b93a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a61a74fce45880eb552a44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我很擅长\r\n等待圣诞老人喔。\r\n晚上我也都能立刻入睡～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0694431317bd8a626042954703cb094241e8b6393cec28f53bffc4b179e21d40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516b66a6611dbcaa053e46c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，无论是忙碌热闹的圣诞节\r\n还是悠哉安静的圣诞节都好，\r\n只要跟你在一起就会很开心～",
      "source_fingerprint": "42abc38c1927ad1b476a852cfff94b91d65be1d717552e9aee1aa10e80f48edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4acbf52cce89895d46e8ff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成功了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "129c0c73b8ca07acc055f8705289f86f7289c05310cbbb624c89eea122fdc5c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c203c3f1a4d7baf8ec11178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说年底很忙碌，但我想\r\n此时更该找时间悠闲地散步。\r\n要不要一起去啊～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01b915ce44556c3502b0c22a5c549b13d03342b61e5a4f7aefd27a55f1a8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488e9da111fafc3a3d08752c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n今天就一起……\r\n睡睡午觉～晒晒太阳吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3822a582ff57c2bf430386f9bafea7a9e63183a032cf1befd4a412139009fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e4369cd79e76541ba5cd10d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送的生日礼物是\r\n跟我的衣服同品牌的\r\n荷叶边衬衫喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c42c655b247f4514ac8f54a6d05f184985543565da001cc60905a350a003e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0f2668df5ba0e2868d8f5cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年赖恩姐姐都会\r\n抢先第一个祝我生日快乐。\r\n呵呵呵～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd1c337951b07bae9f091a9156f7c9c9189275f48164d404aaf3db488ac1b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02338698fe58d53c2f7ef303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福。\r\n虽然步调缓慢，\r\n但我会扎实稳健地持续成长的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2797e153495b86d232598aefa8aeaf9879b48f4c4855d06a1138a023376e4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6109ee2c487b9f4b63345d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到公告了喔～\r\n没问题的，应该才刚收到，\r\n还是新的……应该吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77c8ed8e85a1f8663e634b84a15998a7d222bb48b5f3711451ef53136c794a73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ab0cbce37d578331ea2ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了喔～\r\n希望里面是令人开心的礼物呢，\r\n例如洋娃娃啊、缎带之类的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6cd4ba83c528b728bf164add944318d952ca2e22c3faff81a63741e30db2c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ec3973b091c131470182f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n你已经达成任务了～？\r\n恭喜你～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ddedf4674f3f4bd1a821627b6b1fe7d184818e28a56794ba02802d80187a8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b33710b14ce2e3a210be830c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说即将要举办活动了呢～\r\n得多加注意，\r\n别不小心错过了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1332c26d032c919e3ab92bce02745a83475d8098ab0187d2e774f729ffa5ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d3427bf58399d946ce4d76b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n现在正在举办活动呢～\r\n要不要去试试看呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ce5d140fff3a861ff3cda274f846c572f8e7aa7e46a6f7e0bf9a2bb1c25283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668cfaeffc7be27477e2a0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还有机会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61889f5573eafb7aa310d75cf908350ad92bca1472abfd3fcf4a13a2912c847c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbca4eaaa94c75a881be02db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像提升了～\r\n要去确认看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18ba2b9054ef5fae2d7cd8e105e06feb9cec239c630362a172f965690321c4fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b959a6b80126c4339e656d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミントカラーと大きなフリルを見て\r\n一目ぼれしたお洋服なのです。\r\n可憐で、清楚。メジロのようで～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3b6d9aaaa468fab9109ce468827de69ad4ed009f48f4797052798bb65da188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda95afcca7eeb6cdbce972",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔はライアンお姉さまとドーベルが\r\n片方ずつ三つ編みをしてくれ\r\nましたの。幸せも2倍でしたわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1d729a69d42dbafa0767ecd36973d16bbf278bc998da3376b41ae2ded24811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3984060899ec14db9f47dec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海外のドール作家さんとやりとりを\r\nしたくて、外国語のお勉強をして\r\nおりますの。ぼんじゅーる、ですわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "77605a0221a97bddca905e311603064addd82eb7e4a898f9d375ae1671dedada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f11b629ddb5309b43ad4de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很努力了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d59e5f703d5f47d55b2943b95306ec6ad674a360dca121cc7d2764088c8667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeaba524c0a2faf7b7296330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位都表现得很棒～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c92c146afecdda4b77410b0963edd4430452d6d6de4d1e0bab833e2a85e62dc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7f83e867fd653d891c0c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还有机会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61889f5573eafb7aa310d75cf908350ad92bca1472abfd3fcf4a13a2912c847c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa95ec74a47ad9d32c10a17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很努力了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d59e5f703d5f47d55b2943b95306ec6ad674a360dca121cc7d2764088c8667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c0736f13e4c37309a41c6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，太出色了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d846279282846bbfe67b57ac3f814318c44c596367c8dcb764c3691169aa4c59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693961334e2857676038714b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位～都准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07994cfde89746b9886c0ba91eea6461a95aa88df65de4b79e4117f4878533f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:137a386d02df5c911a42ba48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fc300b87bde86d25b99c8b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请慢慢地～\r\n好好地～地培育我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "01c38d1114f84951da7c4510c97cc6e11bdeaebbfdb3ff8b457700b9ee04be78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7304c2fcc82f6c17374ecbb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习历史的时候～\r\n总是会有点困呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c3b1e35546d000e72b32980d345d9d9feba631e229137cfbe3b0ddcbc1642c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32784b1a3e76da7bfb20adcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想\r\n报名参赛是吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ef910cde8a2d80d26502dcde8355180b3f0a64dc632d1c620e273b950d8614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0cd1e21b2582411afd8c6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc4c9fefc15b0ba401cad03b645cb07d119f6baf3511cc54f6d9d70d9617727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e1336df307a648d6f0a651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现我们的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e97bd4fe17a2097a967be51d8aed18c278778cc7558aafcfc989d847be20423",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d58a596c1a9ded84fededb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deab460d3a10a2bb4dc902cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～？\r\n总觉得心情好奇妙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6811fc2e4d99139c0e60227a460b7c7602cfe5d46f63fcf01ebe5d68ec7024ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cab04da599f1b2c244c78a25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励～",
      "source_fingerprint": "de67a23a6c4ec3a4af8cfa8fd3875bc3f32fae7a6b85d159ea26b7b384981133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e753b608f3089bb59c620c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个孩子\r\n都好可爱呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43968e871d830f7487cfa2a2d69077aee0950905197b20efbdcdfa17cc1de7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d2ddad8acda715bd1b03712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "办到了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82175fb3ad756664b0cdd8f5a84ab47def4155a1e7b6c32dc72c80c8c1867c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb017783aad6fd4df5e847c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6031a720e88adf4612f29166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能夹到这么多～",
